    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: SBQQ__Quote__c records marked as Amendment but with no amendment effective date set.
Why it matters: The amendment has no clear start — subscription proration calculates against the wrong baseline, billing schedules drift, and the customer&apos;s invoice for the amendment period comes out wrong. Quiet revenue leakage on every amended deal.
Suppress a finding: when the amendment is genuinely effective immediately and the team has documented that convention.
Disable the detector: only if your org doesn&apos;t use CPQ amendments. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
